    "baseRefName": "staging",
    "body": "## Summary\nA minimal Firebase measurements service whose processing-integrity controls actually operate: input validation (PI1.2), idempotent transactional processing (PI1.3), SHA-256 integrity-hashed storage (PI1.5), integrity-checked output (PI1.4), published spec + data definitions (PI1.1). Unit-tested (#18).\n\n## Tickets\n| Ticket | Title | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| #18 | Measurements service — processing integrity controls | In Progress |\n\n## Changes\n- app/.gitignore\n- app/Dockerfile\n- app/SPEC.md\n- app/openapi.json\n- app/package-lock.json\n- app/package.json\n- app/src/pi.ts\n- app/src/server.ts\n- app/test/pi.test.ts\n- app/tsconfig.json\n- policies/processing-integrity.md\n- shadow/scope.json\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] app/test/pi.test.ts — validation rejects bad input, integrity hash detects tampering, summary flags mismatch (all pass locally)\n- [x] server.ts is thin I/O wiring over the tested pi.ts logic",
